  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">REACT Household Solar Round 2: Finance to support early-stage enterprises that provide off-grid solar systems to poor households in Nigeria, Ethiopia, Senegal.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity REACT Household Solar Round 2: Finance to support early-stage enterprises that provide off-grid solar systems to poor households in Nigeria, Ethiopia, Senegal. is a component of Africa Clean Energy Programme (ACE) reported by FCDO with a funding type of 111 - Not for profit organisation and a budget of &#xA3;3,727,737. This project benefits Developing countries, unspecified. It works in the following sector(s): Small and medium-sized enterprises (SME) development, Environmental policy and administrative management.</narrative>
  </description>
